  "description": {
    "en": "MSV Bussard is a crisp co-polyester monofilament designed for intermediate to advanced players who attack the ball with full swings and topspin. It delivers very high control and spin potential while special additives improve tension maintenance and durability. Racketpedia measurements supplied by MSV report control scores between 95 and 100 percent and spin scores between 85 and 100 percent depending on gauge. Bussard is recommended for normal and open string patterns, with an official tension recommendation of 20 to 24 kg. Made in Germany.",

    "zh": "MSV Bussard 是一款击球反馈清脆的共聚酯单丝球线，专为使用完整挥拍动作、积极制造上旋的中高级球员设计。它提供极高的控制力和旋转潜力，同时通过特殊添加剂强化保磅与耐久表现。MSV 提供的 Racketpedia 数据显示，根据不同线径，其控制评分达到 95–100%，旋转评分达到 85–100%。Bussard 适合正常及开放式线床，官方建议穿线张力为 20–24 kg（44–53 lbs），产地为德国。"
  },

